# EmailJS — optional.
#
# The contact section is mailto-first and works with no configuration at all.
# Set all three values below to additionally enable the in-page contact form.
# If any are missing, the form is hidden rather than shown in a broken state.
#
# Get these at https://www.emailjs.com/
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
